<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?><!--
     AresLauncher - the cross itself. Composed into a backdrop by ares_remove_badge.xml; that file
     is what callers reference, this one is only its top layer.

     A plain cross rather than a minus or a bin: a bin reads as "delete the app" which is exactly
     the wrong promise (the item leaves the home screen, the app stays installed), and a minus reads
     as "collapse".
-->
